From: mscharged-port
Subject: [PATCH] Admit original authored Boot script0 services and logo cue in a named diagnostic
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Restore unchanged original services2/11/33/15/16 alongside qualified412
services12/13, plus the genuine Boot handler cue/unload, only under an
explicit native BOOT_SCRIPT diagnostic. The original bytecode owns the
service order, waits and callbacks. No IP, stack, readiness or resource
selection is rewritten. Default, console and earlier selectors are intact.
Normal BootLoadingToFE/script6 and CleanBootShutdown/script13/7 remain
separate prerequisites; this is selected function0 integration only.

